\fs28 \cf0 Business Units Overview\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 Cosmox Chemicals is organized into 
\f1\b 10 advanced chemical divisions
\f0\b0 , each focused on delivering high-value solutions with dedicated expertise, advanced manufacturing capabilities, and tailored support for diverse industrial applications. Each division functions as a 
\f1\b center of excellence
\f0\b0 , ensuring consistent quality, regulatory compliance, and global export readiness.\
Our divisions serve industries including 
\f1\b automotive, polymers, electronics, lubricants, pharmaceuticals, coatings, energy storage, and research-driven industrial applications
\f0\b0 . The structured business unit approach enables efficient management of a broad product portfolio, harmonized global operations, and dedicated R&D support for application-specific requirements.\

